<title>AUSTRIA: OMV sees 97 EBIT surging to 5 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>OMV sees 97 EBIT surging to 5 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and chemicals group OMV AG, having reported a doubling of six-month earnings, said on Tuesday it expected to raise full-year earnings before interest and tax (EBIT) to just under five billion schillings.</p>
<p>Last year, OMV posted an EBIT of 2.92 billion schillings.</p>
<p>OMV chief executive Richard Schenz also told journalists he expects full year net profit to be &quot;at least slightly above that posted last year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
